## Core Java

The CoreJava challenges involve both the CoreJava.java file and the Repl.java file.

The CoreJava challenges must be run from the root repo. To run:

challenges.CoreJava

To compile in the event they must be compiled

javac challenges/Repl.java challenges\CoreJava.java
java challenges.CoreJava

---

## SeptemberThird

SeptemberThird.java must be run from the challenges repo:

cd challenges
java SeptemberThird

They should be compiled, but if the need to compile exists:

cd challenges
javac challenges/SeptemberThird.java
java challenges.SeptemberThird

---

## DateTime

javac challenges/DateTime.java
java challenges.DateTime
